rem Factors of Two in Binomials
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=704

use numbers
use bits
use io
use cli

arg Limit integer = 10 ** 16

rem Kummer: F(n) = k - min(v2(n+1), k)
rem with k = floor(log2 n). A full
rem block 2^k..2^(k+1)-1 sums to
rem (k-1) 2^k + 1. In the last block
rem count the multiples of 2^t.
Top = (Limit binary len) - 1
Blocks = 1 to Top - 1
Sums = (Blocks - 1) * 2 ** Blocks + 1
Full = Sums sum
Levels = 1 to Top
Count = (Limit + 1) // 2 ** Levels
Extra = Count - 2 ** (Top - Levels)
Cut = Extra sum
Size = Limit - 2 ** Top + 1
Tail = Top * Size - Cut
Answer = Full + Tail
Answer print
